 "game_version": "16.22",
 "updated": "14 Nov 2026",
 "headline": "Ekko, Xayah and Kog'Maw lead patch 26.22",
 "lede": "<b>36 of the 65</b> most-picked champions (5% or more of their role's games) win less than half of them. Built on <b>1.9 million Emerald+ games</b> from OP.GG, plus four more stat sites at Diamond+, corrected for small samples and one-tricks.",
 "takes": {
  "top": "Singed is the outlier, with Kayle, Malphite and Shen behind him. Higher up Kayle and Singed lead Diamond+, Fiora leads Master+, and Malphite drops to A in Master+. Jayce and Yone are picked a lot and still lose, and Yasuo dropped more than anyone since last patch.",
  "jungle": "Zyra, Wukong, Lillia and Rek'Sai lead Emerald+. Lillia is the only outlier there, Zyra misses the 2% pick an outlier needs by a hair (1.9%). Higher up Zyra is the outlier in Diamond+ and Master+, Rek'Sai too in Master+, and Rek'Sai scores highest of all in Diamond+. Lee Sin is in 13% of games and loses, and Qiyana is the worst popular pick in the role.",
  "mid": "Ekko is the outlier at every rank. Vex and Vladimir follow in Emerald+, Katarina and Zoe in Diamond+, Taliyah and Zoe in Master+. Mel gained the most since last patch and Viktor is up too, but Viktor is still a trap at 7.7% pick.",
  "adc": "Kog'Maw and Xayah are the outliers in Emerald+ and Diamond+. Nilah scores about as high as Xayah, but she is in only 1% of games. Of the usual ADCs Corki gained the most since last patch. Ezreal is in 15% of games and has the worst score of any popular ADC.",
  "support": "Taric and Rell score highest in Emerald+ with Leona, Braum and Zilean right behind, so pick what fits your bot laner. Taric is in only 1.2% of games, so his number is less certain. Rell is the outlier in Master+, where Taric scores even higher but is picked too rarely to be one. Yuumi, Karma and Lux are popular and lose, and Thresh dropped the most since last patch."
 },
